License not yet chosen
======================

This repository does not yet include a license chosen by the copyright holder.

Cargo.toml (and the vendored crate manifests) currently contain
`license = "MIT OR Apache-2.0"`. That string is not a license grant: the MIT
and Apache-2.0 license texts are not in this tree, and the owner has not
confirmed the choice for a public release.

TODO(owner): pick a license, add its text in place of this file, and make
every Cargo.toml `license` field match. Until then, all rights reserved.
